<title>USA: Pan Am completes $25 mln private placement.</title>
<headline>Pan Am completes $25 mln private placement.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pan Am Corp said Monday it has completed a private placement of $25 million in convertible preferred securities of which the company has received $15 million.</p>
<p>The balance is due upon closing the previously announced acquisition of Carnival Air Lines.</p>
<p>Pan Am said that 23,734,596 primary common shares would be outstanding after the conversion of this preferred issue at the fixed price and the closing of the acquisition of Carnival Air Lines, in which Air Holding Corp would receive 9.5 million shares of Pan Am common stock.</p>
</text>
